1
00:00:00,190 --> 00:00:02,370
My marketing plugin for Claude Code

2
00:00:02,370 --> 00:00:04,030
just got a huge update.

3
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:05,060
Two commands,

4
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:07,270
and you get fourteen marketing skills.

5
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:08,141
Research,

6
00:00:08,141 --> 00:00:08,922
calendars,

7
00:00:08,922 --> 00:00:09,620
SEO,

8
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:09,885
ads,

9
00:00:09,885 --> 00:00:10,292
email,

10
00:00:10,292 --> 00:00:10,700
video,

11
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:12,250
and publishing.

12
00:00:12,430 --> 00:00:14,460
Ask for a competitor battlecard,

13
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:17,250
and it searches the web and cites every source.

14
00:00:17,430 --> 00:00:18,940
It plans a week of posts,

15
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:21,700
and never repeats last week's topics.

16
00:00:21,890 --> 00:00:24,360
One blog post becomes a LinkedIn post,

17
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:25,170
a thread,

18
00:00:25,170 --> 00:00:26,690
and a newsletter.

19
00:00:26,870 --> 00:00:28,570
It reads a subreddit's rules

20
00:00:28,570 --> 00:00:30,130
before it writes your post.

21
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:31,130
Then the big one:

22
00:00:31,130 --> 00:00:32,250
video.

23
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:32,768
First,

24
00:00:32,768 --> 00:00:34,540
it asks what you've got:

25
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:35,470
where you post,

26
00:00:35,470 --> 00:00:36,152
who presents,

27
00:00:36,152 --> 00:00:37,180
a video you like,

28
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:38,910
and the tools you pay for.

29
00:00:39,090 --> 00:00:40,330
It writes the script,

30
00:00:40,330 --> 00:00:41,150
voices it,

31
00:00:41,150 --> 00:00:43,430
and renders the video on your own machine.

32
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:44,780
Thirty-two templates,

33
00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:47,250
from tier lists to text-message skits.

34
00:00:47,430 --> 00:00:49,390
And a 3D mascot that walks,

35
00:00:49,390 --> 00:00:49,711
talks,

36
00:00:49,711 --> 00:00:51,700
and lip-syncs to the voice.

37
00:00:51,890 --> 00:00:53,530
Or bring your own character,

38
00:00:53,530 --> 00:00:56,190
from a cartoon to a realistic avatar.

39
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:57,940
Send it a video you love,

40
00:00:57,940 --> 00:01:00,030
and it copies how it's edited.

41
00:01:00,220 --> 00:01:01,880
Nothing posts or sends

42
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:03,360
until you say yes.

43
00:01:03,540 --> 00:01:04,134
It's free,

44
00:01:04,134 --> 00:01:05,210
open source,

45
00:01:05,210 --> 00:01:07,250
and it works in Codex too.

46
00:01:07,450 --> 00:01:07,601
Oh,

47
00:01:07,601 --> 00:01:08,660
and this video?

48
00:01:08,660 --> 00:01:10,020
It made this too.

49
00:01:10,210 --> 00:01:10,990
If it helps,

50
00:01:10,990 --> 00:01:13,910
a star on GitHub helps other people find it.

51
00:01:14,090 --> 00:01:15,440
What should it make next?

52
00:01:15,440 --> 00:01:17,013
Tell me in the comments.
